### FoodLine Campus — 1-Click In-Editor API Testing Suite
### Install "REST Client" or "Thunder Client" in Extensions (Ctrl+Shift+X) to run these with 1 click!

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### 1. Health & Database Connectivity Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Fetch Menu & Categories (Cafe @7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menu

### 3. Fetch Campus Break Slots & Capacity Meters (60 Cap)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/slots

### 4. Create Pre-Order (Reserves Slot & Generates Token + OTP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": "slot-1",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "dish-1",
      "name": "Dabeli",
      "price": 25,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "dish-2",
      "name": "Masala Chai",
      "price": 15,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "studentName": "Shivam Nirmal",
  "studentPhone": "9876543210",
  "studentPrn": "SU2026CS01",
  "notes": "Extra spicy please"
}

### 5. Verify 12-Digit UTR Bank Reference (Fraud Shield)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/verify-utr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderToken": "FL-3804",
  "utrNumber": "928374615243",
  "amount": 65
}

### 6. Get Order Details by Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order/FL-3804

### 7. Kitchen Status Transition (Kitchen Tablet KDS)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/kds/orders/sample-order-id/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "READY"
}

### 8. Quick Stockout Toggle (1-Tap Cafeteria Staff)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/kds/inventory/sample-dish-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isAvailable": false
}

### 9. Admin Business Metrics & FSSAI / DPDP Compliance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/metrics

### 10. Verify Student 4-Digit Pickup OTP (Express Counter Handover)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderToken": "FL-3804",
  "pickupOtp": "6065"
}

### 11. Signup Validation Failure (Missing/Invalid Email -> Expect 400 VALIDATION_EMAIL_REQUIRED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### 12. Signup Success (Valid Email -> Expect 201 & Async Google Sheets Audit Log)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test.user@sanjivani.edu.in",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

